WEBVTT

00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:05.733
The item objective is required; countdown is a failure condition in seconds

00:00:05.733 --> 00:00:09.367
Connect failure to a recovery subquest instead of ending everything

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:17.200
Leave the materials unsubmitted and watch the eight-second timer

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.967
Timeout activates recovery; it does not count as delivery success
